    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet, windswept beauty of Cornwall, Sophie finds herself drawn to the enigmatic Emma, her host's charming and artistic sister. What begins as a simple visit soon turns into a tale of suppressed desire, deep friendship, and love that defies society's expectations. Against the backdrop of a rural estate, their bond grows as they sketch, bake, and navigate the unspoken rules of Victorian propriety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But can love truly blossom in a world so bound by duty and convention?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Portrait of a Cornish Woman</i> is a Victorian Romance Kinetic Visual Novel of Manners, capturing the subtle, yet powerful emotions of two women as they fight for their place in each other's lives while living under a veil of discretion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic and emotional storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Anime Style Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piano and chamber orchestra soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
